/TU (IF YOU NEED HELP\056 If you need help with this report\054 complete as much of it as you can\056 Then call the phone number provided on the letter sent with the report or the phone number of the person who asked you to complete the report for help to finish it\056 If you cannot speak or understand English\054 we will provide an interpreter free of charge\056 WHAT YOU NEED TO COMPLETE THIS REPORT\056 \200  Information about all the jobs that you had in the last 5 years before you became unable to work\056 \200  ANSWER EVERY QUESTION FOR EACH JOB YOU DESCRIBE unless the report indicates otherwise\056 Provide as much detail as possible\056 \200  If you cannot remember all the information about your jobs\054 provide what you do remember\056 If you do not know an answer\054 or the answer is \042none\042 or \042does not apply\054\042 please write \042don\047t know\042 or \042none\042 or \042does not apply\056\042 \200  Be sure to explain an answer if the question asks for an explanation\054 or if you want to provide additional information\056 \200  If you need more space to answer any questions\054 use Section 3 \055 Remarks\056 REMEMBER TO PROVIDE THE INFORMATION ABOUT THE PERSON\015COMPLETING THIS REPORT IN SECTION 4\056)
/Type /Annot
