/TU (Paperwork Reduction Act Statement \055 This information collection meets the requirements of 44 U\056S\056C\056\247 3507\054 as amended by Section 2 of the Paperwork Reduction Act of 1995\056 You do not need to answer these questions unless we display a valid Office of Management and Budget control number\056 We estimate that it will take about 40 minutes to read the instructions\054 gather the facts\054 and answer the questions\056 SEND OR BRING THE COMPLETED FORM TO THE STATE AGENCY \015THAT REQUESTED IT\056 If you have questions about how to complete the form\054 contact the \015State Agency that requested it\056 If you need the address or phone number for your State Agency\054 you can get it by calling Social Security at 1\055800\055772\0551213 \050T T Y 1\055800\055325\0550778\051\056  You may send comments on our time estimate above to\072 SSA\054 6401 Security Boulevard\054 Baltimore\054 MD 21235\0556401\056 Send only comments relating to our time estimate or any other aspects of this collection to this address\054 not the completed form\056 AFTER COMPLETING THIS REPORT\054 REMOVE THIS SHEET\015AND KEEP IT FOR YOUR RECORDS)
/Type /Annot
